Inno Setup Simplified Chinese installer messages
================================================

ChineseSimplified.isl is copied byte-for-byte from the official jrsoftware/issrc
repository, tag is-6_7_1, commit cfdf48923178df4b4f040e038b423aa555a61ffc.
Upstream path: Files/Languages/Unofficial/ChineseSimplified.isl
The translation is maintained by Zhenghan Yang (Kira); all original header
comments, attribution, URLs and messages are retained without modification.
It was classified as an unofficial translation in this pinned upstream release.
This copy is a build input for Inno Setup 6.7.1, not a PCL RH translation.

